---
import GuideLayout from '../layouts/GuideLayout.astro';
---
<GuideLayout title="MW4 on Steam" lang="zh-CN">
  <div slot="definition">
    <p>本页说明如何在 <strong>Steam</strong>（及其他常见平台入口）获取 MW4，并指向 Early Access 相关说明。</p>
    <p>价格、折扣、地区锁与 SKU <strong>一律以商店页实时展示为准</strong>；本站不写价格承诺。</p>
  </div>
  <ol slot="how-to">
    <li>按下表选平台 → 跳官方或商店页（编码落地时挂外链）。</li>
    <li>EA 资格与内容边界 → <a href="/early-access-mw4/">/early-access-mw4/</a>。</li>
    <li>发售时间线 → <a href="/mw4-release/">/mw4-release/</a>；回导览 <a href="/dmz-mw4/">/dmz-mw4/</a>。</li>
  </ol>
  <div slot="body">
    <div class="table-scroll">
      <table>
        <caption>平台与购买入口（草稿，链接待核）</caption>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Platform</th><th scope="col">How to get MW4</th><th scope="col">Notes</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Last verified</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Steam</td><td>打开 Steam 上的官方 MW4 商店页（URL 待核后填）</td><td>不编造 AppID / 价格 / 捆绑包名</td><td>reported（链接待核）</td><td>2026-10-24</td></tr>
          <tr><td>官方汇入口</td><td><a href="https://www.callofduty.com/modernwarfare4/dmz">callofduty.com · MW4 DMZ</a> 购买/平台区</td><td>以页上购买区为准</td><td>confirmed（入口页存在）</td><td>2026-10-24</td></tr>
          <tr><td>其他主机商店</td><td>（待核：PlayStation / Xbox 等商店链）</td><td>本批不展开未核平台细节</td><td>reported</td><td>2026-10-24</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <h3>FAQ</h3>
    <div class="table-scroll">
      <table>
        <caption>Steam / 平台购买 FAQ（草稿，待核）</caption>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Q</th><th scope="col">A</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Last verified</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Can I get MW4 on Steam?</td><td>以 Steam 与官方购买区是否上架为准；上架后把商店链写入上表并改 <code>confirmed</code>。</td><td>reported（待核）</td><td>2026-10-24</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Does Steam purchase include Early Access?</td><td>EA 是否含在特定 SKU/版本中，以商店页与 <a href="/early-access-mw4/">/early-access-mw4/</a> 边界小节为准；此处不承诺。</td><td>reported（待核）</td><td>2026-10-24</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Will this page list prices?</td><td>否。价格易变，请以商店页为准。</td><td>confirmed（站内策略）</td><td>2026-10-24</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div slot="sources" class="table-scroll">
    <table>
      <caption>Sources · 来源与更新日期（草稿，待核）</caption>
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">#</th><th scope="col">Source</th><th scope="col">Date</th><th scope="col">Notes</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr id="source-1"><td>1</td><td><a href="https://www.callofduty.com/modernwarfare4/dmz">Official MW4 DMZ</a></td><td>2026-10-24</td><td>官方购买/平台汇入口</td></tr>
        <tr id="source-2"><td>2</td><td>（待补）Steam 商店页</td><td>—</td><td>核验后填 URL</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</GuideLayout>
